  "notes": [
    "Anchor and campaign come from every Swap event with the flash-swap flag set on Avalanche from genesis to the chain head (77 events, all in transactions that also called addLiquidity on the same pair; none before block 66175400), plus the later transactions of the eight senders in which a pair lost AVAX (LP burns of LP minted in earlier flash transactions, e.g. 0x091206ff's six removals, and 0x13459bc2's follow-ups). The DeFiHackLabs tx 0xab813aee (2025-07-28 06:34 UTC) is the 17th such transaction; the first is 0x0636a938's at 03:52 UTC.",
    "The 24 pairs are 13 deployments of the anchor's verified BIFKN314Mintable runtime (21,279 bytes, byte-identical), 9 of an unverified 21,277-byte build exploited by the same sequence, and two EIP-1167 clones of the verified BIFKN314 implementation 0x666a53d7 (RPEPE 0x694207a9, INF 0x8888ba1a), whose flashSwap likewise takes no lock: sibling deployments of one codebase (rule 4). Only the anchor's pair is a target. Its reset is the deployment: resets.mjs lists a flag set in slot 0xa beside the LP-token address 967 blocks later (initialization/trading switch, rule 8) and live reserve, price and fee slots after it.",
    "Loss is loss.mjs over the 24 pairs: 3,804.40 AVAX left them, of which about 303.7 AVAX were FeesDistributed payouts to the factory fee address 0x3bf59726 triggered inside the exploit transactions (without them the AVAX loss is about 3,501.7 AVAX, 92.3k USD). RPEPE is priced by DefiLlama; the other pair tokens taken in LP burns are unpriced and, not having been sold back within these transactions, add nothing (rule 12). 1.58 AVAX the attackers paid into pairs is not subtracted."
  ]
